            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "It's an emergency. My team was attacked by Reunion as well."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "I rushed over to join you as soon as I could."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Why would Reunion attack us...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "An organization made up of the Infected... I've always thought they were a bit extreme..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "...and now they've resorted to violence, and in an Ursus city no less? That's a death wish."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "The situation is only going to get more chaotic from here on out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Amiya, we need to leave Chernobog right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Okay. We've already rescued the Doctor, so we can retreat according to plan."
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
