    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "No, no..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Um, Dobermann, Doctor isn't doing very well right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "To put it simply, Doctor... has amnesia."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Amnesia?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "...What are you going to do now? Weren't you planning to transfer leadership to\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Doctor still has the capacity to command."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...At least, I've confirmed that from the previous battle."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 2
        }
